  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Botanical Field Atlas",
    "overview": "Forest navigation, pale paper surfaces, and quiet dividers frame dense scientific observations. The workspace prioritizes readable measurements, familiar controls, and clear selections. Its botanical character comes from its palette rather than decorative illustration.\n\nThe implementation combines custom analysis surfaces with shadcn primitives. Light and dark themes preserve semantic roles; scientific figures remain white independently of the application theme.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Forest navigation and restrained green selection.",
      "Compact summaries with tabular measurements.",
      "Bordered analysis surfaces and familiar form controls.",
